    "source": "Isolated macOS 27 VM during the WinMux browser-tab CPU audit: one Safari window, 704x680 points, 24 static local pages, the first tab active and the tab bar scrolled to its end.",
    "normalization": "Titles replaced with \"Tab NN\" in tab-bar order; page content, favicon and title-text children, the address field value, window UUID, process IDs and web-view process IDs omitted. AXSelected read as error -25205 (attribute unsupported) on every tab; AXValue carries selection.",
    "observation": "Tabs 02-08 sit outside the visible tab bar (frame 0,736 32x32) and answer AXParent with error -25212 (kAXErrorNoValue), yet the tab bar lists them among its AXChildren. Every other tab, including the active one, names the tab bar as its parent."
